 before  landing the part of jason in stranger  things you may know him as tom galligan  in bosch damon from finding carter or  garrett from season 4 of the 2011 teen  wolf reboot dye has also been featured  prominently in a couple of web series  such as secret diary of an american  cheerleader and roommates  what's jonathan byers to do after moving  far away from his childhood home and  girlfriend to finish up high school in  sunny california make a new stoner  friend and start getting high of course  jonathan's new predilection for cannabis  is the source of some great comedic  moments in stranger things four as is  his new best friend argyle from his  extra-long hair and his love of  recreational drugs to his job as a pizza  delivery driver argyle is the complete  california stereotype hand rolled into  one chilled out package  why do you just go to the van  and do your thing  huh purple laundry delay if you've seen  2019's book smart then you're already  familiar with eduardo franco's unique  brand of comedy in the olivia wilde  directed teen comedy franco plays theo a  character who bears a striking  similarity to argyle franco is also  featured in movies like the binge and  super intelligence from 2020 as well as  2021's we broke up franco previously got  major screen time on netflix as spencer  diaz in american vandal in addition to  other tv appearances on adam ruins  everything gamer's guide to pretty much  everything and gabby's dollhouse among  others  after entering the secret site of the  nina project eleven takes a journey into  her memories specifically some of her  most traumatic days as a test subject of  dr martin brenner within those memories  she re-encounters peter an assistant to  the good doctor who seems at first to  have her best interests and heart but  peter contains multitudes imdb describes  him as friendly orderly and peter even  though that isn't his original name it  isn't long before his involvement in the  greater story of the show 